iki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span><span>51</span><span>52</span><span>53</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>66</span><span>67</span><span>68</span><span>69</span><span>70</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; semantic QE convention"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.5.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span> (free-variable operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\)</span> (quantifier-free formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (models of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (assignments, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_L\\)</span> (satisfaction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QE}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{QE}_L\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\psi)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_L\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\psi)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用原书 §1.5 印刷 pp.50–54 的语义等价约定：等价式在所有总赋值下成立，量词自由式允许无用的自由变量。原书 Theorem 1.5.3 对句子也允许输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0=v_0\">\\(v_0=v_0\\)</span> 或其否定；无常元语言没有量词自由句子，故不能额外要求自由变量严格包含于输入的自由变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","